scenario recount over g1
  tally 2
  from 2026-03-01
  note "a recount of the wallet in the scenario's world (invented; review-g8.md's list): gap beside a scenario reading and a base one"

version recount_2026
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  pad wallet from spent
  stated[wallet] = 230.00 PLN at 2026-03-31 end "recounted"

ask s_gap: gap(wallet, 2026-03-31) in recount

ask s_gap_base: gap(wallet, 2026-01-31) in recount

ask s_flows: flows(wallet, 2026-03) in recount

ask s_bal: bal(wallet, 2026-03-31) in recount
